WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.903
MuSc is a zero-shot method for industrial anomaly
detection and segmentation,

00:00:05.983 --> 00:00:10.643
with no training, no prompts, and no normal
reference images.

00:00:10.723 --> 00:00:16.315
Its insight: unlabeled test images hold enough cues
to score one another.

00:00:16.395 --> 00:00:20.200
Published at ICLR 2024, it tops MVTec AD and VisA.
